  "_comment": "Canonical Conway inference provider set (A13). Deployed copy: <stateDir>/inference-providers.json, read by ProviderRegistry.fromConfig from src/agent/loop.ts. A config file REPLACES DEFAULT_PROVIDERS rather than merging it (src/inference/provider-registry.ts:283-286), so every provider Conway should be able to use is restated here in full. Invalid JSON is swallowed and the built-in defaults are used instead (src/inference/provider-registry.ts:300-302) - keep this file parseable.",
  "_credential": "No key material lives in this file. FreeLLMAPI's /v1 surface authenticates with its unified API key (freellmapi server/src/lib/inference-auth.ts:13-20 returns 401 authentication_error without it); the registry reads it from process.env.FREELLMAPI_API_KEY at call time (src/inference/provider-registry.ts:446-450). With that variable unset the registry sends the documented placeholder 'missing-freellmapi_api_key', which FreeLLMAPI rejects. FreeLLMAPI's own /api/tags and /api/chat (Ollama wire) are separate, keyless surfaces and are NOT used by this provider record.",
  "_modelIds": "Model id 'auto' is FreeLLMAPI's virtual router model - the gateway picks the best currently available route (freellmapi server/src/routes/proxy.ts:47,475). Pinned upstream ids churn as free providers come and go, so they are deliberately not used here. contextWindow is a declared ceiling, not a guarantee: the real ceiling depends on which upstream the router lands on, and FreeLLMAPI publishes its own figure as context_window/context_length on GET /v1/models.",
